UME_SENTINEL&#xa;resumeIntentKind + resumeKnownSlots → dispatch intent THẬT trong tryTurn" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1010" y="590" width="230" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n30" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=0;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n25" target="n26"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n31" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=0;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n26" target="n27"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n32" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=0;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n27" target="n28"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n33" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=0;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n28" target="n29"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n34" value="còn thiếu" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=0;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#333333;dashed=1;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n27" target="n26"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n35" value="Domain action tools (fitness-agent-tools.ts, ~30 hàm)&#xa;findPTCandidates · generateRoadmapDraft · applyTrainingPlan · createNutritionLog … gọi HTTP thật, response Zod-validated" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="730" width="300" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n36" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=0;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n29" target="n35"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n37" value="Draft → Preview → Confirm → Execute&#xa;(sửa draft: tryReviseWorkoutPlanDraft; mọi write chỉ sau xác nhận, ghi FitnessAgentAction)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="730" width="260" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n38" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=0;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n35" target="n37"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n39" value="Sinh plan: đẩy job vào queue → worker (trang 4)&#xa;generation-admission + generation-operations (chống trùng / stale attempt)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="730" width="270" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n40" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=0;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n37" target="n39"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n41" value="Audit / provenance: RecommendationAudit · CoachClientActionAudit · FitnessAgentAction&#xa;Coach/PT: server tự verify quan hệ PT↔client, không tin clientId trong body" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1010" y="730" width="430" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n42" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=0;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n39" target="n41"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n43" value="Vai trò &quot;agent&quot;: (1) Router/Interpreter (regex + semantic CI-V2 + LLM tùy chọn) → (2) Workflow orchestrator (state, slot) → (3) Domain tools (đọc/ghi qua service nghiệp vụ) → (4) Narrator (LLM diễn giải, có validator &amp; fallback) → (5) Confirmation boundary (con người duyệt). Ranking / ghi dữ liệu KHÔNG BAO GIỜ do model suy ra." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="890" width="1430" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="p3" name="4. Sinh plan va Ingest"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="1200"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="n2" value="Đường bất đồng bộ: sinh workout/nutrition plan (worker) và ingest tri thức vào vector DB" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1300" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" value="A. Sinh workout plan — workers/ai.worker.ts::processAiTaskJob" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontStyle=1;dashed=1;fontSize=13;opacity=60;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="60" width="780" height="880" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" value="API tạo Plan(PENDING) → đẩy job &quot;ai-tasks&quot;&#xa;(BullMQ/Redis hoặc SQS + Lambda worker)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="110" width="720" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" value="withGenerationOperation: claim thao tác bền vững&#xa;(chống trùng delivery / stale attempt)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="185" width="720" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n6" value="Validate job data (Zod PlanJobData) → plan = PROCESSING" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="260" width="720" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n7" value="Lấy ALLOWED exercises từ fitness-service&#xa;(/internal/exercises/for-ai-plans — theo goal, địa điểm, thiết bị)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="335" width="720" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n8" value="Lấy context cá nhân (InBody, lịch sử tập, dinh dưỡng)&#xa;— lỗi thì bỏ qua, vẫn sinh plan" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="410" width="720" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n9" value="Dựng catalog theo từng ngày + analyzeBodyComposition&#xa;→ retrieveEvidence (RAG fitness_evidence)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="485" width="720" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n10" value="Prompt → LLM (JSON) sinh lịch tuần&#xa;(timeout có đường recovery)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="560" width="720" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n11" value="Repair xác định: repairDayCandidateExercises,&#xa;repairScheduleLengthAndEmptyDays (từ catalog thật)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="635" width="720" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n12" value="validateWorkoutPlanInvariants + enforceFinalPlanEquipmentInvariant&#xa;(Exercise.id hợp lệ, đúng nhóm cơ, đúng thiết bị)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="710" width="720" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCe